{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "加班到了极限  (Overtime Already at Its Limit)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Furious that a Xingtian executive secretly contacted rival ME host Luo Lin, DTS strips Unit Two of the weekly talk show and asks Chun Yuqiao to take full charge. Listen to Yuqiao, Kaiwen, and Xingzi in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "电视台主任看得很明白，其他几个部和我们一部相比简直是天壤之别。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一线卫视最注重的就是节目品质。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "所以主任要求二部所有人全部撤出，把文娱论正式转给一部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "主任还希望老大直接全面接管这档节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我所有的员工，他们的加班时间已经到了极限。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我自己现在也抽不出空来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "约定之外的制作项目，我们实在没法兼顾。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "主任已经让人马上打电话约董事长沟通了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总这次在会上闹成这样，真是太出格了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这件事情咱们先别告诉别人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这还用咱们去告诉别人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们担心他丢人，人家自己可不在乎，怕是更丢人的还在后头呢。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "电视台主任看得很明白，其他几个部和我们一部相比简直是天壤之别。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The network director sees clearly that the other units are worlds apart from Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一线卫视最注重的就是节目品质。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a top-tier television network values most is programme quality.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "所以主任要求二部所有人全部撤出，把文娱论正式转给一部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So the director ordered everyone in Unit Two out and formally handed the talk show to Unit One.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "主任还希望老大直接全面接管这档节目。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The director also wants our boss to step in and take over the show completely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我所有的员工，他们的加班时间已经到了极限。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For all of my staff, overtime hours have already hit the absolute limit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我自己现在也抽不出空来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I cannot spare any extra time myself right now either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "约定之外的制作项目，我们实在没法兼顾。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We simply cannot juggle extra production projects beyond what was agreed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "主任已经让人马上打电话约董事长沟通了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The director already had his assistant call to schedule a talk with the chairwoman.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总这次在会上闹成这样，真是太出格了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For Mr Sun to cause a scene like that in the meeting really crossed the line.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这件事情咱们先别告诉别人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us not tell anyone else about this incident yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这还用咱们去告诉别人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Does anyone even need us to tell them?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们担心他丢人，人家自己可不在乎，怕是更丢人的还在后头呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We worry about him losing face while he could not care less — worse embarrassment lies ahead.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "电视台主任看得很明白，其他几个部和我们一部相比简直是天壤之别。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一线卫视最注重的就是节目品质。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "所以主任要求二部所有人全部撤出，把文娱论正式转给一部。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "主任还希望老大直接全面接管这档节目。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我所有的员工，他们的加班时间已经到了极限。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我自己现在也抽不出空来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "约定之外的制作项目，我们实在没法兼顾。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "主任已经让人马上打电话约董事长沟通了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "孙总这次在会上闹成这样，真是太出格了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这件事情咱们先别告诉别人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这还用咱们去告诉别人吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们担心他丢人，人家自己可不在乎，怕是更丢人的还在后头呢。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Refusing to burn out his already exhausted crew without structural reform, Yuqiao leaves DTS taking its complaint straight to Xingtian's chairwoman. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
